e.","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5850259,"review":"Amazing place","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5854609,"review":"Our stay was extremely nice and peaceful to which we had a very good nights sleep,bed was very comfy,the apartment had all you need in a beautiful part of Eygpt,I would definitely stay at thus apartment again and again","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5886989,"review":"I expected a professional property management service and you guys really meet expectations.\r\n\r\nThanks for offering such a good service. ","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5894997,"review":"The location is perfect, the apartment is well furnished and well equipped","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5916781,"review":"Amazing stay.\n\nApartment was great and El Gouna is the perfect place if you’re looking for a clean, secure and relaxing place to visit in Egypt","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5936796,"review":"The place was as described and clean. we stayed 2 nights and we appreciated the flexibility of our host.","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5960039,"review":".","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6005124,"review":"amazing","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6077048,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nAir-conditioning issues from the first day (check-in).\n\nThe unit was not clean, with garbage bags left inside.\n\nDamage in the living room.\n\nAir freshener not working at all, with unpleasant smells coming from the bathroom.\n\nBroken lamp.","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6090978,"review":"Can use some improvements in their internal communication and readiness of the house before guests arrive but their responsiveness and willingness to help makes them reliable. \nThey are also transparent and quick to act. \nThank you for the stay!","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6095612,"review":"Everything was smooth and nice but the ac in the living room wasn’t working","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6100933,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6117456,"review":"L’endroit était parfait, calme et agréable à vivre. La vue sur la piscine était magnifique. \nLe service client était très réactif et sympathique merci beaucoup ☺️","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6139563,"review":"Xuru team was very responsive and friendly.","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6152851,"review":"Had an amazing stay \nEverything was 10/10","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6162162,"review":"The AC in the master bedroom was not working and I have reported to XURU team. The AC was not fixed through my three nights stay and we couldn’t sleep at all from the extreme heat. The communication with the team was very poor and that was the worst experience ever.","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"},{"id":6173179,"review":"Initially, we had difficulty finding the apartment because we received incorrect information regarding the apartment number and internet password. We waited for over an hour trying to find a way to contact them since we didn't have internet access. We kept searching for the apartment with many bags, which was very tiring. I had contacted them several times before arriving about the cleanliness of the apartment; I wanted it to be spotless when I arrived, but unfortunately, it wasn't clean. The floor needed cleaning. The location of the apartment was good, and the only good thing was their quick response.","rental_id":248906,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}